VED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26066854932982747", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27360019536999607"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "793177010529253"}]}, "change_log": "**MAJOR UPDATE 6/30/2026 - Version No. 5**\n\n \n\n\n\n**NOTICE: This update will wipe ALL bookmarks** \n\n\nSorry for the inconvenience.\n\n\n\n\n**Upgraded the epub reader:**\n\n\nepub search functionality\n\n\ntext & page color controls\n\n\nfont size controls\n\n\ninline images (plus interactable images)\n\n\nadded % to progress tracker\n\n\n\n\n**Bug fixes:**\n\n\nfixed overlapping import buttons\n\n\nchanged hold-to-delete times\n\n\nchanged wording on some buttons to more clearly communicate their function\n\n\nfixed blurry ui elements\n\n\nfixed book interactions through objects\n\n\nfixed keyboard overlapping with menu buttons", "created_date": 1782823453, "id": "27276819488652946", "version": "5", "version_code": 15, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}